    <h1>A thank-you to those who serve, <em>with your second month free</em></h1>
    <p>If you've served in the military, work as a first responder, or hold a license in medicine, dentistry, nursing, allied health, or mental health, your second month is free. Your family qualifies too. You pay the standard $175 for the first month, which starts the build, and nothing for the second.</p>
    <p>Jump to: <a href="#veterans" class="inline-link">Veterans</a> &middot; <a href="#first-responders" class="inline-link">First responders</a> &middot; <a href="#medical" class="inline-link">Medical professionals</a></p>
  </div>
